{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "يَرْفَعُ", "translation": "(was) raising"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ", "translation": "Ibrahim"}, {"text": "ٱلْقَوَاعِدَ", "translation": "the foundations"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيْتِ", "translation": "the House"}, {"text": "وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلُ", "translation": "and Ishmael"}, {"text": "رَبَّنَا", "translation": "(saying), \"Our Lord"}, {"text": "تَقَبَّلْ", "translation": "Accept"}, {"text": "مِنَّآ ۖ", "translation": "from us"}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "translation": "Indeed You"}, {"text": "أَنتَ", "translation": "[You] (are)"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمِيعُ", "translation": "the All-Hearing"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَلِيمُ", "translation": "the All-Knowing"}], "sahih": "And [mention] when Abraham was raising the foundations of the House and [with him] Ishmael, [saying], \"Our Lord, accept [this] from us. Indeed, You are the Hearing,1 the Knowing.2"}